        "content_locator": "已讀 HTML 全文；換行分隔文字節點",
        "excerpt": "The Committee decided to maintain the target range for the federal funds rate at 3-1/2 to 3-3/4 percent, in support of the Federal Reserve's dual mandate. The Committee is continuing its policy of maintaining ample reserves in the banking system.",
        "claim_kind": "fact",
        "source_status": "revised"
