        "available_at": "2026-09-15T06:31:14Z",
        "content_locator": "已讀 HTML 全文後節選；字元區間：0:6000,8017:11534",
        "excerpt": "Revenue of\n$29.6 billion\nfor the third quarter, up 86 percent from the prior year period\nGAAP operating income of\n$16.0 billion\nfor the third quarter; Non-GAAP operating income of\n$20.1 billion\nfor the third quarter\nGAAP diluted EPS of\n$2.68\nfor the third quarter; Non-GAAP diluted EPS of\n$3.32\nfor the third quarter\nCash from operations of\n$14.2 billion\nfor the third quarter, less capital expenditures of\n$0.5 billion\n, resulted in\n$13.7 billion\nof free cash flow, or 46 percent of revenue",
        "claim_kind": "fact",
        "source_status": "revised"
      },
      "symbols": [
        "AVGO"
      ],
      "summary": "文件表示：Broadcom FY2026 第三季（截至 2026/8/2）營收為 29.6B 美元（年增 86%）；GAAP 營業利益為 16.0B 美元、非 GAAP 營業利益為 20.1B 美元；營業現金流 14.2B 美元減資本支出 0.5B 美元後形成自由現金流 13.7B 美元（相當於營收 46%）。",
      "market_relevance": "此處的收入成長、獲利與現金流釋放程度，可能影響市場對其 AI 相關半導體/網通需求與後續資本配置（例如股利或回購）的評估。",
      "interpretation": "untrusted_observation"
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "official-d6612b350fb9335b51f04dddcfdeeab4",
      "source_url": "https://www.bea.gov/news/2026/personal-income-and-outlays-july-2026",
      "published_at": null,
      "available_at": "2026-09-15T12:00:04Z",
      "retrieval": {
        "document_id": "5895968b941e893ae940f010268634dd017bbc4c4058557676a7d36a9b08e05d",
        "content_hash": "131a34937193d5631ac80c606ab233febeb7cbbb267ac6ccdaf9a091a9fee9f7",
        "source_query": "https://www.bea.gov/news/current-releases",
        "source_type": "macro_release",
        "authority": "official",
        "retrieved_at": "2026-09-15T15:05:09.598966Z",
        "publication_date": "2026-08-26",
        "publication_precision": "date",
        "available_at": "2026-09-15T12:00:04Z",
        "content_locator": "已讀 HTML 全文；換行分隔文字節點",
        "excerpt": "Personal income\nincreased $115.1 billion\n(0.4 percent at a monthly rate) in July, according to estimates released today by the U.S. Bureau of Economic Analysis (BEA).\nDisposable personal income (DPI)\n—personal income less personal current taxes—increased $125.9 billion (0.5 percent), and\npersonal consumption expenditures (PCE)\nincreased $36.3 billion (0.2 percent).\nPersonal outlays\n—the sum of PCE, personal interest payments, and personal current transfer payments—increased $36.6 billion in July.\nPersonal saving\nwas $712.0 billion in July, and the\npersonal saving rate\n—personal saving as a percentage of DPI—was 3.0 percent.",
        "claim_kind": "fact",
        "source_status": "revised"
      },
      "symbols": [
        "AVGO",
        "CASH",
        "GLD",
        "META",
        "NVDA",
        "PLTR"
      ],
      "summary": "文件指出：BEA 估計 2026 年 7 月個人所得增加 115.1B 美元（按月化成長 0.4%）；可支配所得（DPI）增加 125.9B 美元（0.5%）；個人消費支出（PCE）增加 36.3B 美元（0.2%）。同時，個人儲蓄為 712.0B 美元，儲蓄率為 DPI 的 3.0%。",
      "market_relevance": "消費與收入的按月變化可作為短期需求動能的宏觀線索，可能間接影響與消費/服務相關產業的景氣預期。",
      "interpretation": "untrusted_observation"
    },
